{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/958676-inspiring-podcast","id":958676,"title":"Inspiring Podcast","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-08-27T04:09:43-07:00","id":958676,"title":"Inspiring Podcast","content":"<a href=\"http://www.tanispodcast.com/\" target=\"_blank\">TANIS</a> is a podcast by the same people who do The Black Tapes. Basically it's about a guy who sets out seeking mystery and gets drawn into a deep web of... something.<br /> <br /> Apart from being a cool story in itself, it's really not hard to read it as a nascent Hunter or Mage, or Stigmatic. Tanis itself could be an aspect of the God-Machine, or a Verge, or even a Wound. It's exactly what would happen if people began sniffing around something they can't understand - everyone has a different theory and use for Tanis.<br /> <br /> Anyway, search indicated nobody else had shared it, so I thought I'd share the love and potential inspiration.<br /> <br /> Anyone have any other podcasts or web series they find good for inspiration?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1mSW2-p-SwmYw5gaqnVMQ7HcRNhVedC-aA4vB6sBclGk/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Commandments for GMs</a> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1hslzrmui6ML-v7LniQUXLNyy8o52YF9g2u6usdu-Drc/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Commandments for Players</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/207-allan53","name":"Allan53","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"966"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-27T05:27:33-07:00","id":958698,"title":"","content":"Alice Isn't Dead 